---
layout: broadcast.njk
title: Timeline
description: Season-by-season basketball timeline for Kevin Franz Jr. — every tracked team from 2023 through the current JC Hoops 16U season, with records and averages.
permalink: /timeline/
active: timeline
---

{%- set allSeasons = seasons.seasons -%}
{%- set current = (allSeasons | hasValue("isCurrent")) | first -%}

<section style="padding:80px 56px 56px; background:var(--b-bg); border-bottom:1px solid var(--b-line);">
  <div style="font-family:'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size:11px; letter-spacing:0.14em; color:var(--b-green-bright); text-transform:uppercase; margin-bottom:24px;">&bull; TIMELINE &middot; {{ allSeasons | length }} TRACKED SEASONS</div>
  <h1 class="b-tl-h1" style="font-family:'Archivo', sans-serif; font-weight:900; font-size:150px; line-height:0.85; letter-spacing:-0.045em; text-transform:uppercase; margin:0; color:var(--b-text);">
    The<br><span style="-webkit-text-stroke:2px var(--b-green-bright); -webkit-text-fill-color:transparent;">road.</span>
  </h1>
  <p style="font-family:'Inter', sans-serif; font-size:18px; line-height:1.6; color:var(--b-mute); margin-top:32px; max-width:660px;">
    Every season with a tracked box score, newest first &mdash; high school, club and middle school. Records and averages come straight from the GameChanger season pages linked on each row.
  </p>
</section>

{# ===== SEASON TABLE ===== #}
<section class="b-gamelog">
  <div class="b-tl-head" style="display:grid; grid-template-columns:130px minmax(0,1fr) 110px 86px 90px 1fr 100px; gap:12px; padding:14px 48px; border-bottom:1px solid var(--b-line); background:var(--b-bg-2); font-family:'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size:10px; letter-spacing:0.14em; text-transform:uppercase; color:var(--b-mute);">
    <div>SEASON</div><div>TEAM</div><div>LEVEL</div><div>#</div><div>RECORD</div><div>PPG / RPG / APG</div><div>SOURCE</div>
  </div>
  {% for s in allSeasons %}
    <div class="b-tl-row" style="display:grid; grid-template-columns:130px minmax(0,1fr) 110px 86px 90px 1fr 100px; gap:12px; padding:18px 48px; border-bottom:1px solid var(--b-line); align-items:center; background:{% if s.isCurrent %}var(--b-bg-2){% elif s.isFeatured %}var(--b-bg-2){% else %}var(--b-bg){% endif %}; {% if s.isCurrent %}border-left:3px solid var(--b-green-bright);{% elif s.isFeatured %}border-left:3px solid var(--b-amber);{% else %}border-left:3px solid transparent;{% endif %}">
      <div style="font-family:'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size:12px; color:var(--b-text); letter-spacing:0.04em;">
        {{ s.season }}
        {% if s.isCurrent %}<div style="color:var(--b-green-bright); font-size:9px; letter-spacing:0.14em; margin-top:4px;">CURRENT</div>{% endif %}
        {% if s.isFeatured %}<div style="color:var(--b-amber); font-size:9px; letter-spacing:0.14em; margin-top:4px;">FULL LOG</div>{% endif %}
      </div>
      <div>
        <div style="font-family:'Archivo', sans-serif; font-weight:800; font-size:16px; color:var(--b-text); line-height:1.25;">{{ s.team }}</div>
        {% if s.detailNote %}<div style="font-family:'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size:10px; color:var(--b-mute); margin-top:4px;">{{ s.detailNote }}</div>{% endif %}
      </div>
      <div style="font-family:'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size:10px; letter-spacing:0.1em; color:var(--b-mute); text-transform:uppercase;">{{ s.level }}</div>
      <div style="font-family:'Archivo', sans-serif; font-weight:900; font-size:18px; color:{% if s.jersey %}var(--b-text){% else %}var(--b-mute){% endif %};">{% if s.jersey %}#{{ s.jersey }}{% else %}&mdash;{% endif %}</div>
      <div style="font-family:'Archivo', sans-serif; font-weight:800; font-size:15px; color:var(--b-text);">{% if s.record != 'n/a' %}{{ s.record }}{% else %}<span style="color:var(--b-mute); font-weight:400; font-size:12px;">n/a</span>{% endif %}</div>
      <div style="font-family:'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size:12px; color:var(--b-mute); letter-spacing:0.04em;">
        <span style="color:var(--b-text);">{{ s.ppg }}</span> / <span style="color:var(--b-text);">{{ s.rpg }}</span> / <span style="color:var(--b-text);">{{ s.apg }}</span>
        <div style="font-size:10px; margin-top:4px;">{{ s.gp }} GP / {{ s.gs }} GS &middot; FG {{ s.fgPct }}</div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <a href="{{ s.statsUrl }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="font-family:'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size:10px; letter-spacing:0.1em; color:var(--b-green-bright); text-transform:uppercase; text-decoration:none; white-space:nowrap;">STATS &rarr;</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  {% endfor %}
  <div class="b-gamelog-foot">
    {{ seasons.note | upper }}
  </div>
</section>

{# ===== NARRATIVE SEASON PAGES ===== #}
{% set years = collections.timeline %}
{% if years | length %}
<div class="b-section-head">
  <div class="b-section-head-left">
    <span class="b-section-tag">/01 SEASON PAGES</span>
    <h2 class="b-section-title">In my<br>words.</h2>
  </div>
</div>
<section class="b-grid b-grid-3 b-grid-bordered">
  {% for item in years %}
    <a href="{{ item.url }}" style="background:var(--b-bg); padding:32px 28px; text-decoration:none; color:var(--b-text); display:flex; flex-direction:column; min-height:200px;">
      <div style="font-family:'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size:10px; letter-spacing:0.14em; color:var(--b-green-bright); text-transform:uppercase; margin-bottom:14px;">{{ item.data.year }}{% if item.data.season %} &middot; {{ item.data.season }}{% endif %}</div>
      <h3 style="font-family:'Archivo', sans-serif; font-weight:900; font-size:20px; text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:-0.01em; margin:0 0 10px; line-height:1.15;">{{ item.data.team or item.data.grade }}</h3>
      <p style="font-size:14px; color:var(--b-mute); line-height:1.6; margin:0; flex:1;">{{ item.data.summary }}</p>
      <span style="font-family:'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size:10px; letter-spacing:0.12em; color:var(--b-green-bright); text-transform:uppercase; margin-top:18px;">READ &rarr;</span>
    </a>
  {% endfor %}
</section>
{% endif %}
